WEBVTT

00:07:30.821 --> 00:07:34.742
and you think you may want
to go on your own hero's quest,

00:07:34.742 --> 00:07:37.536
I'm here to tell you to do it.

00:07:38.621 --> 00:07:41.332
And if they don't believe you, show them!

00:07:41.957 --> 00:07:44.668
The world needs the most unique voice.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:45.711
Thank you.

00:07:45.753 --> 00:07:52.718
(Applause)